{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 When used as a separate service, the Exhortation, page 316, may be\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 read, or a homily preached.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Decalogue may be said, the people kneeling.\par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Celebrant may read one of the following sentences}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Jesus said, {\u8220\'93}The first commandment is this: Hear, O Israel:\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 The Lord our God is the only Lord. Love the Lord your\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 God with all your heart, with all your soul, with all your\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 mind, and with all your strength. The second is this: Love\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 your neighbor as yourself. There is no other commandment\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 greater than these.{\u8221\'94}   }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Mark 12:29-31}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 If we say that we have no sin, we deceive ourselves, and the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 truth is not in us. But if we confess our sins, God, who is\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 faithful and just, will forgive our sins and cleanse us from all\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 unrighteousness.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 1 John 1:8,9}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 Since we have a great high priest who has passed through the\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 heavens, Jesus, the Son of God, let us with confidence draw\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 near to the throne of grace, that we may receive mercy and\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 find grace to help in time of need.   }{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Hebrews 4:14,16}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 The Deacon or Celebrant then says}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-908\tx-720\tx0\tx540\tx1080\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8460\tx9000\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
