}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Silence may be kept.}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3   \par
}{\plain \fs20 \i\f3\fs20 Minister and People}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-908\tx-720\tx0\tx540\tx1080\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8460\tx9000\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-908\tx-720\tx0\tx540\tx1080\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8460\tx9000\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 Most merciful God, \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we confess that we have sinned against you\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 in thought, word, and deed,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 by what we have done,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and by what we have left undone.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 We have not loved you with our whole heart;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 we have not loved our neighbors as ourselves.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 We are truly sorry and we humbly repent.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 For the sake of your Son Jesus Christ,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 have mercy on us and forgive us;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 that we may delight in your will,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 and walk in your ways,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 to the glory of your Name. Amen.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3 \par
