{\plain \fs24 \f3 We believe in one Lord, Jesus Christ,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     the only Son of God,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     eternally begotten of the Father,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     God from God, Light from Light,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     true God from true God,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     begotten, not made,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     of one Being with the Father.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     Through him all things were made.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     For us and for our salvation\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3         he came down from heaven:\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     by the power of the Holy Spirit\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3          he became incarnate from the Virgin Mary,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3          and was made man.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3  For our sake he was crucified under Pontius Pilate;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3      he suffered death and was buried.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     On the third day he rose again\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3          in accordance with the Scriptures;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     he ascended into heaven\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3          and is seated at the right hand of the Father.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     He will come again in glory to judge the living and the dead,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3          and his kingdom will have no end.\par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1\tx-908\tx-720\tx0\tx540\tx1080\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8460\tx9000\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720 
{\plain \fs24 \f3  \par
}\pard \fs24\tx-908\tx-720\tx0\tx540\tx1080\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8460\tx9000\tx10080\tx10800\tx11520\tx12240\tx12960\tx13680\tx14400\tx15120\tx15840\tx16560\tx17280\tx18000\tx18720
{\plain \fs24 \f3 We believe in the Holy Spirit, the Lord, the giver of life,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     who proceeds from the Father and the Son.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     With the Father and the Son he is worshiped and glorified.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     He has spoken through the Prophets.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     We believe in one holy catholic and apostolic Church.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     We acknowledge one baptism for the forgiveness of sins.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3     We look for the resurrection of the dead,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f3          and the life of the world to come. Amen.\par
